						</div>
						<div class="promo-side">
							<a class="promo-cta" href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=69050&amp;awinaffid=3126073&amp;ued=https%3A%2F%2Fakkogear.eu%2F" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" target="_blank" data-awin-link data-awin-mid="69050">Voir AKKO →</a>
						</div>
					</li>
					<li class="promo-card">
